msgid "There is a fundamental tradeoff between anonymity and performance."
msgstr "May pangunahing trade-off sa pagitan ng anonymity at performance."

msgid "Tunnels longer than 3 hops (for example 2 hops + 0-2 hops, 3 hops + 0-1 hops, 3 hops + 0-2 hops), or a high quantity + backup quantity, may severely reduce performance or reliability."
msgstr "Ang mga tunnel na mas mahaba sa 3 hops (halimbawa 2 hops + 0-2 hops, 3 hops + 0-1 hops, 3 hops + 0-2 hops), o mataas na quantity + backup quantity, ay maaaring matinding bawasan ang performance o reliability."

msgid "High CPU and/or high outbound bandwidth usage may result."
msgstr "Maaaring magresulta sa mataas na paggamit ng CPU at/o ng outbound bandwidth."

msgid "Change these settings with care, and adjust them if you have problems."
msgstr "Ingat na baguhin ang mga setting na ito, at ayusin ang mga ito kung mayroon kang problema."

msgid "Exploratory tunnel setting changes are stored in the router.config file."
msgstr "Naiimbak sa router.config file ang mga pagbabago sa setting ng exploratory tunnel."

msgid "Client tunnel changes are temporary and are not saved."
msgstr "Pansamantala lamang ang mga pagbabago sa client tunnel at hindi ini-save."

